'''Suidae Piggicus''' (超豚獣ピーギィ, ''Chō Tonjū Pīgyi'', '''Super Pig-Beast Piigyi''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Pigge]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. It was added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

