==Enemy==
Suidae Piggicus is a relatively tough peon, with nearly 1M health at 100% strength magnification and moderately high DPS, essentially a longer-ranged [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] without the [[Wave Attack]]s. It has a 20% chance to freeze units for 2 seconds and is immune to knockback and slow as well.

==Strategy==
By Behemoth standards, Suidae Piggicus is actually very easy to deal with. 980k health seems intimidating at first, but its low range and somewhat slow attack rate make it easy to defend against, while its exploitable attributes greatly reduces the scope of its threat. Both [[:Category:Behemoth Slayer Cats|Behemoth Slayers]] and [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien units]] all have something to offer if they have a damage-based ability, such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N102 (Rare Cat)|Catarzan]]. Its immunities don't matter much, either, as it can be stalled just fine with only meatshields and knockback is rarely used against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] in the first place, though [[Ancient Egg: N105 (Rare Cat)|Racquet Cat]] does become less effective against it. Overall, it's generally the support of other enemies that tend to be of greater concern than Suidae Piggicus.

