==Trivia==
*[[wikipedia:Suidae|Suidae]] is the family of mammals commonly known as pigs.
*Piggicus is a portmanteau of ''pig'' and names commonly associated with British aristocracy, such as ''Atticus'', ''Ignatius'', or ''Cornelius''.
**Given its former status as [[Elizabeth the LVIth]]'s pet, it can be assumed that this is the name given to it by Elizabeth herself. This makes its official name "Pig Piggicus".
*Suidae Piggicus's design, description and Japanese name (ピーギィ ''Pīgyi'', "Piigyi"), reference [[wikia:monsterhunter:Poogie|Poogie]] (プーギー ''Pūgī'') a customizable pet pig in the ''Monster Hunter'' games. Its striped fur resembles Poogie's original outfit, the Memorial Stripes.
*The [[Enemy Guide]] listed Suidae Piggicus's traits as "([[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] / [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]])", unlike most other Behemoths added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]] and onward, which were listed as "(Trait) (Behemoth)". This was fixed by [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]].

